cters bring the adventure to life.\n\nCrunchies is an epic action-packed battle for survival aboard a restored Sherman tank as Hank and his crew struggle to survive a zombie apocalypse.\n\nKey Features:\n- Annihilate massive enemy hordes with superior firepower!\n- 16 exciting open environments to explore, chock-full of destructible objects!\n- Simplified controls: thumbstick drives, point to aim, trigger/grip fire cannon/machinegun.\n- Graphics that maximize your Quest's potential, plus tweakable settings for future headsets.\n- 4 levels of difficulty offer great replay value.\n", "short_description": "Fight to survive a zombie apocalypse: with a tank!  Experience the action-packed storyline with M4A3 Sherman \"Cherry Bomb\" and her stalwart crew.  Vaporize hordes of enemies with cannon-fire or crush them beneath steel treads!  A colorful cast of characters bring the adventure to life."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://crunchies.space/crunchies/privacy.aspx", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VROOM", "support_website_url": "https://crunchies.space/", "website_url": "https://crunchies.space/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "HORROR", "SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "292393016380483"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 18, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1109211351728576"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1057721047010154"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2085875602315773"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1693155498482101"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1597003544740411"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1211270844232514"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "950664784097788"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1442062450820741"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1586984699396187"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1275702950992348"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "654906760986548"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3996091680717990"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1218400170008676"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "950536726939226"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3737722143224471"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1229567561301813"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "517985879909234"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2588171291314157"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "654906760986548"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1797271200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1109211351728576"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "5677008942326229", "version": "1.02"}, "id": "2053479558136141", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "5386480711379055", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "5677008942326229"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2053479558136141"}]}, "change_log": "\u2022 Added mixed-reality mode, so you can play on your floor or kitchen table! (Cutscenes still play in VR.)\n\u2022 In mixed reality, grab the playspace with the secondary controller to move it, and use its thumbstick to scale and rotate it.\n\u2022 Added a \"Swap Controllers\" option for lefties.\n\u2022 Replaced the \"View Behind\" button with AR/VR toggle.\n\u2022 Forward throttle is now \"sticky\", so you don't have to hold it anymore; just press down to cancel it.\n\u2022 The thumbstick button now sets a \"drive to\" point on terrain, which is also available when weapons are disabled.\n\u2022 Most models now render faster.\n\u2022 Explosions use less memory and cause less stutter.\n\u2022 Simplified hundreds of colliders for faster physics.\n\u2022 The tank keeps more of its speed when turning.\n\u2022 Optimized all shaders.\n\u2022 Fixed zombie pathfinding.\n\u2022 Zombies are now flat-shaded.\n\u2022 Improved automatic draw distance.\n\u2022 Fixed enemy vehicles in Wasteland destroying each other, and gave them the ability to back-up.\n\u2022 More zombies spawn at higher difficulties, up to twice as many on \"Insane\".\n\u2022 Added customizable controls.\n\u2022 Added a visual gradient to menu buttons.\n\u2022 Added ground-fog to Wasteland and Doctor levels.", "created_date": 1793984997, "id": "30354202940846820", "version": "1.10", "version_code": 200024, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "5386480711379055", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "5677008942326229"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1793912781, "id": "30341931072074007", "version": "1.10", "version_code": 200017, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "An